      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 9,
          "section": null,
          "quote": "Furthermore, a substantial density of coherent L1 2 γ’ precipitates is uniformly dispersed within the FCC matrix. These L1 2 γ’ precipitates exhibit thermal stability at elevated temperatures, thereby augmenting the strength of IN738LC via precipitation strengthening.",
